function backTorso(t,s=1,stripes=0){let st='';for(let i=0;i<6;i++){const k=clamp(stripes*6-i);if(k>0){st+=`<path d="M${-30-i*8},${-150+i*50}L${-150},${-110+i*50}M${30+i*8},${-150+i*50}L${150},${-110+i*50}" stroke="#D9433F" stroke-width="20" stroke-linecap="round" opacity="${fmt(0.75*k)}"/>`;}}
 return g(`scale(${s})`,`<path d="M-210,-200Q-230,-260 -150,-270L150,-270Q230,-260 210,-200L190,260L-190,260Z" fill="#F3C9A8" stroke="${OL}" stroke-width="8" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M0,-240L0,240" stroke="#D9A98A" stroke-width="8"/>${st}<circle cx="0" cy="-330" r="80" fill="#2E2430"/>`);}
function hand(t,s=1,o={}){const crack=o.crack;return g(`scale(${s})`,`<rect x="-120" y="-20" width="240" height="220" rx="60" fill="#F3C9A8" stroke="${OL}" stroke-width="7"/>`+[-90,-30,30,90].map((x,i)=>`<rect x="${x-26}" y="${-200+(i==0||i==3?40:0)}" width="52" height="210" rx="26" fill="#F3C9A8" stroke="${OL}" stroke-width="7"/><path d="M${x-14},${-80+(i==0||i==3?40:0)}l28,0M${x-14},${-20+(i==0||i==3?40:0)}l28,0" stroke="#D9A98A" stroke-width="5"/>`).join('')+`<rect x="-200" y="20" width="110" height="52" rx="26" fill="#F3C9A8" stroke="${OL}" stroke-width="7" transform="rotate(-30 -120 40)"/>`+(crack?`<text x="140" y="-160" font-family="B2" font-weight="800" font-size="70" fill="#FFE27A" stroke="${OL}" stroke-width="10" paint-order="stroke" opacity="${fmt(crack)}">KREK!</text>`:''));}
